summary:
  A heartbeat tick that came hours late still counts as on time.

history:
  The timer stands still with the machine; its first tick after a wake is
  the one tick that must not count.

target:
  package/contents/ui/RetryLogic.js

find:
      return prevAt > 0 && nowAt - prevAt <= 2 * intervalMs;

replace:
      return prevAt > 0;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_retrylogic.qml::test_a_tick_after_the_machine_slept_is_late.
  Line-neutral.
